# 🐳 Panduan Lengkap Instalasi & Setup Docker (PHP 8.5 FPM Stack) — {{ APP_NAME }}

Repositori ini telah dilengkapi arsitektur kontainerisasi produksi berkinerja tinggi (**PHP 8.5 FPM**, **Nginx Alpine**, **PostgreSQL 16 Strict ULID**, **Redis 7**, dan **Mailpit Sandbox**) yang siap dijalankan secara lokal maupun server mandiri.

---

## 🏗️ Arsitektur Kontainer Stack

```text
       [ Browser / Klien HTTP ]
                  │ (Port 8000 / 80)
                  ▼
       ┌────────────────────────┐
       │   Nginx Alpine (web)   │ ── FastCGI Buffering & Static Caching
       └────────────────────────┘
                  │ (Port 9000 Internal)
                  ▼
       ┌────────────────────────┐
       │  PHP 8.5 FPM (app)     │ ── Laravel 13 Core, Opcache, BCMath, GD, Redis Ext
       └────────────────────────┘
            │              │
            │ (Port 5432)  │ (Port 6379)
            ▼              ▼
 ┌─────────────────┐ ┌───────────────┐
 │ PostgreSQL 16   │ │ Redis 7       │
 │ (Strict ULID)   │ │ (Cache/Queue) │
 └─────────────────┘ └───────────────┘
```

| Layanan | Nama Container | Port Host | Fungsi |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **App** | `{{ SHORT_SLUG }}_app` | *Internal (9000)* | PHP 8.5 FPM Alpine + Laravel 13 + Composer 2 |
| **Web** | `{{ SHORT_SLUG }}_web` | `8000:80` | Nginx Alpine Reverse Proxy & Static Asset Caching |
| **PostgreSQL** | `{{ SHORT_SLUG }}_postgres` | `5432:5432` | Relational Database Engine (Strict ULID 26 Char DDL) |
| **Redis** | `{{ SHORT_SLUG }}_redis` | `6379:6379` | In-Memory Cache, Rate Limiter & Queue Worker Broker |
| **Mailpit** | `{{ SHORT_SLUG }}_mailpit` | `8025:8025` | Local Email Testing Web Sandbox (`1025` SMTP) |

